  "notes": [
    "Pencil foliation 377; no date. The proposition states F-torsion for Exti(Ga,Ga) under the right Hom action with bound i>1, written over 0. The corollary attributes a perfection statement to Milne and claims Exti(Ga^parf,Ga^parf)=0 for i>1. The proof then explicitly changes to sheaves of Fp-modules and says “On travaille mod F (au sens mod C)” before the Ext1=0 line; that qualification is retained in interpreting the line.",
